WEBVTT

00:00.870 --> 00:05.439
Now then, we've successfully secured
this lighthouse that operates the barrier

00:05.440 --> 00:08.950
and lit the signal fire of uprising.

00:09.580 --> 00:12.409
Before we launch our full-scale operation,

00:12.410 --> 00:14.429
let's review our situation.

00:14.430 --> 00:16.699
First things first...
Wait...

00:16.700 --> 00:18.459
What's with you guys?

00:18.460 --> 00:22.120
Weren't you planning to start a revolution
with Raphtalia as your leader?

00:22.570 --> 00:24.730
My head...

00:26.030 --> 00:27.130
Water...

00:27.660 --> 00:31.779
It's because big sister Sadeena
challenged them to a drinking contest.

00:31.780 --> 00:32.470
Oh?

00:32.920 --> 00:36.290
Honestly, how disgraceful.

00:36.930 --> 00:39.270
Get a grip, you hangovers!

00:39.740 --> 00:42.110
We don't have time to waste.

00:45.420 --> 00:46.590
Anyway,

00:46.900 --> 00:50.149
where exactly is this so-called
Heavenly Emperor in Q'ten Lo?

00:50.150 --> 00:54.549
If possible, I want to take care of him
real quick and just bring an end to all this.

00:54.550 --> 00:59.460
The current Heavenly Emperor
is in the present capital here.

00:59.850 --> 01:03.269
Oh? The capital wasn't there
when I lived here.

01:03.270 --> 01:06.589
The capital was relocated when the current
Heavenly Emperor came to power.

01:06.590 --> 01:08.300
I see.

01:08.850 --> 01:13.180
The city where the past Heavenly Emperors
resided is now called the Old Capital.

01:13.550 --> 01:16.679
It would be wise to secure this place first.

01:16.680 --> 01:18.899
Yeah, that's thoughtful.

01:18.900 --> 01:20.139
What do you mean?

01:20.140 --> 01:21.509
The capital...

01:21.510 --> 01:25.730
Now the Old Capital, has the site
where the Heavenly Emperor is appointed.

01:26.230 --> 01:28.699
If Raphtalia performs the ceremony there,

01:28.700 --> 01:31.870
we'll be able to use the same blessings.

01:32.580 --> 01:37.579
I see. That would be crucial for gaining
advantages in the battles ahead.

01:37.580 --> 01:42.719
Still, abandoning the capital that's lasted
for generations is a bold move.

01:42.720 --> 01:47.929
It's all the work of Makina, who as regent
controls the entire current regime.

01:47.930 --> 01:51.389
Makina... So she's still around.

01:51.390 --> 01:53.799
She's an evil woman.

01:53.800 --> 01:55.899
Evil woman, huh.

01:55.900 --> 02:01.449
Then there's a chance she'll try to retake
this lighthouse we've seized.

02:01.450 --> 02:03.549
We must be ready for a counterattack.

02:03.550 --> 02:04.329
Yes, sir!

02:04.330 --> 02:06.770
Now then, aside from that,

02:07.210 --> 02:10.119
today let's have Raphtalia
dress in a miko outfit

02:10.120 --> 02:13.079
and parade through town to
boost the people's morale.

02:13.080 --> 02:15.499
So it comes to that after all.

02:15.500 --> 02:18.469
Why does everyone get motivated
just because I wear a miko outfit?

02:18.470 --> 02:19.490
Because it suits you.

02:26.580 --> 02:27.650
What's that?

02:28.540 --> 02:33.010
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

02:33.630 --> 02:36.929
EPISODE 8: OROCHI

02:36.930 --> 02:39.139
An enemy attack already?

02:39.140 --> 02:42.759
Or did the townsfolk finally
take things too far?

02:42.760 --> 02:44.640
An odd sound for that, I think.

02:45.210 --> 02:47.730
I'm sensing a strange flow of life force.

02:48.910 --> 02:51.179
What was that noise just now?!

02:51.180 --> 02:52.990
It's noisy out there.

02:55.770 --> 02:57.690
Ah! Look!

03:00.700 --> 03:03.309
It's coming from around the burial mound.

03:03.310 --> 03:04.949
What on earth...

03:04.950 --> 03:07.210
A monster!

03:07.540 --> 03:09.209
The dust makes it hard to see,

03:09.210 --> 03:12.920
but we can confirm it's
a multiple-serpent monster!

03:13.610 --> 03:15.889
Multiple-serpent monster?

03:15.890 --> 03:17.820
Hey, young boy!

03:18.180 --> 03:22.430
Looks like the rulers of this country
don't care what methods they use.

03:22.840 --> 03:27.939
They'd even break the seal on that monster
to protect their own position.

03:27.940 --> 03:29.319
Seal?

03:29.320 --> 03:30.729
You know something?

03:30.730 --> 03:32.959
I ain't answering you, you bastard!

03:32.960 --> 03:35.159
Why should I tell a bastard

03:35.160 --> 03:37.690
- who won't even make a harem?!
- This guy...

03:41.160 --> 03:44.619
Oh? But you'll tell me, right?

03:44.620 --> 03:48.259
Of course, pretty lady.
I'll tell you.

03:48.260 --> 03:50.529
There are ancient ruins
in those mountains.

03:50.530 --> 03:55.670
A monster that caused serious damage to our
country long ago is now sealed in those ruins.

03:55.990 --> 03:59.889
Officially, the legend says
the Heavenly Emperor defeated it.

03:59.890 --> 04:02.839
Defeated, not sealed?

04:02.840 --> 04:05.719
I also only ever heard
that it was defeated.

04:05.720 --> 04:08.369
Because of the location,

04:08.370 --> 04:11.899
only a tiny handful of people
in the government know the truth.

04:11.900 --> 04:15.639
Only a government-appointed blacksmith
like me would know that.

04:15.640 --> 04:17.610
Why claim it was defeated?

04:19.560 --> 04:24.449
Because that monster strengthens
the barrier that cuts off

04:24.450 --> 04:26.369
Q'ten Lo from the outside world.

04:26.370 --> 04:28.829
In a sense, it's like a divine protector.

04:28.830 --> 04:32.789
There are several such ruins
scattered across the land.

04:32.790 --> 04:37.969
So the government has
revived one of those creatures?

04:37.970 --> 04:40.260
Pretty much.

04:40.640 --> 04:44.909
What's even more troublesome is,
not too long ago,

04:44.910 --> 04:48.819
the current Heavenly Emperor,
that little shit, started doting on monsters.

04:48.820 --> 04:53.020
He said it's to lessen the burden
on the divine guardian.

04:53.330 --> 04:57.709
So he went around to every sealed site
and placed Sakura Stones of Destiny

04:57.710 --> 04:59.949
and blessings at each one.

04:59.950 --> 05:01.110
Is he out of his mind?!

05:01.450 --> 05:04.899
Placed blessings on monsters that
once brought calamity to the nation

05:04.900 --> 05:06.899
and then revived them?!

05:06.900 --> 05:09.580
Even yesterday,
we struggled against that bear!

05:10.390 --> 05:12.480
Master Naofumi, what should we do?

05:14.630 --> 05:17.099
It's troublesome, but also an opportunity.

05:17.100 --> 05:17.919
Huh?

05:17.920 --> 05:22.609
If Raphtalia, seen as the new Heavenly Emperor,
defeats the revived monster

05:22.610 --> 05:25.829
before it can harm the towns or the people,
and we spread word of it

05:25.830 --> 05:28.520
throughout the country,
what do you think will happen?

05:29.420 --> 05:31.270
Oh, in other words...

05:32.760 --> 05:35.539
The gap between the current government
that neglects its people

05:35.540 --> 05:39.359
and the revolutionary forces who fought
for the people would only become clearer.

05:39.360 --> 05:40.839
Revolutionary forces...

05:40.840 --> 05:42.609
We are the revolutionary forces!

05:42.610 --> 05:47.449
Before the town suffers any damage,
we'll take that monster down quickly!

05:47.450 --> 05:48.620
Gaelion!

05:50.770 --> 05:52.489
Speed takes priority.

05:52.490 --> 05:55.159
We'll split up and ride
Gaelion and Filo to get there.

05:55.160 --> 05:56.380
Understood!

05:57.580 --> 06:01.029
Brother, I don't know if you'll be
much help, but we must go too.

06:01.030 --> 06:01.959
Yeah!

06:01.960 --> 06:03.830
Huh, wait, Atla?!

06:08.870 --> 06:12.520
We'll form up a unit
and follow after you!

06:14.900 --> 06:17.399
I won't lose to Gaelion!

06:17.400 --> 06:19.230
Go!

06:19.520 --> 06:21.490
Ladies!

06:21.880 --> 06:26.169
If things get dangerous, use that guy
as a shield and run, alright?

06:26.170 --> 06:28.850
Seriously, master...

06:37.930 --> 06:41.879
A Hydra, huh. That's definitely
a troublesome monster.

06:41.880 --> 06:44.840
Seven, eight...
No, it's not multiple creatures.

06:45.170 --> 06:48.680
It has eight heads!
Just like the Yamata no Orochi!

06:50.830 --> 06:53.229
A shimenawa rope with
the Sakura Stone of Destiny,

06:53.230 --> 06:55.639
and likely blessings placed on it too.

06:55.640 --> 06:58.650
They've really powered it up.

07:02.250 --> 07:05.159
It got Sakura Stone of Destiny's barrier,

07:05.160 --> 07:07.149
and it even has blessings.

07:07.150 --> 07:10.199
If we get too close,
the Heroes' blessings will be weakened.

07:10.200 --> 07:12.910
If we don't defeat it quickly,
the town will suffer damage...

07:15.370 --> 07:17.349
I can sense a dragon's power.

07:17.350 --> 07:20.589
Perhaps the Water Dragon is aiding us.

07:20.590 --> 07:24.050
That sounds promising.
But still...

07:24.370 --> 07:28.569
It's only a matter of time.
Naofumi, let's finish this in one strike.

07:28.570 --> 07:32.090
Yeah. I'll take the lead and deploy
the Sakura Sphere of Influence.

07:36.100 --> 07:39.559
Itsuki, you've already registered your
Sakura Stone of Destiny weapon, right?

07:39.560 --> 07:40.469
Yes!

07:40.470 --> 07:41.899
All taken care of.

07:41.900 --> 07:44.359
I can fight too!

07:44.360 --> 07:47.319
The old blacksmith guy
gave us weapons!

07:47.320 --> 07:52.540
I see. So it makes up for the Hero's Growth
Correction that was being nullified.

07:52.870 --> 07:54.909
As expected of you, old man!

07:54.910 --> 07:56.449
What?!

07:56.450 --> 07:59.039
Big brother! Hand that over to me!

07:59.040 --> 08:00.699
Didn't you get one too, Atla?!

08:00.700 --> 08:04.339
That pervy old man rudely clasped
my hand when he gave me the item,

08:04.340 --> 08:05.459
and so I tossed it away!

08:05.460 --> 08:10.089
Atla, you'll stay in the rear and support
Itsuki, Rishia, and S'yne.

08:10.090 --> 08:11.160
Understood?

08:12.240 --> 08:13.559
Understood...

08:13.560 --> 08:17.590
Let's go! Sakura Sphere of Influence!
Attack Support!

08:22.060 --> 08:24.550
Here I come!

08:27.880 --> 08:30.029
It doesn't seem to have much defense.

08:30.030 --> 08:33.290
But if Gaelion had classified this as a Hydra...

08:35.120 --> 08:36.580
I knew it!

08:37.490 --> 08:39.330
Not yet!

08:39.790 --> 08:41.959
Get me in there!

08:41.960 --> 08:42.750
Yes!

08:50.370 --> 08:53.049
Aim for the torso!
That part looks more suspicious!

08:53.050 --> 08:54.940
There!

09:03.270 --> 09:05.380
It's so hard.

09:23.920 --> 09:26.590
It's absorbing some of the Dragon Vein power.

09:27.180 --> 09:32.050
To break the barrier, we'll likely need to
sever all eight heads simultaneously.

09:32.360 --> 09:35.029
What do we do?
Fighting this thing too long is foolish.

09:35.030 --> 09:36.149
I know!

09:36.150 --> 09:37.260
Everyone, listen up!

09:37.790 --> 09:40.519
Raphtalia will destroy
the Orochi's blessing first!

09:40.520 --> 09:43.599
Then we'll cut off all the heads simultaneously

09:43.600 --> 09:46.859
to break the barrier on the body
and finish it in one go!

09:46.860 --> 09:47.479
Got it?!

09:47.480 --> 09:48.399
Yes!

09:48.400 --> 09:51.199
Sadeena, you'll perform
a chanted support spell with me.

09:51.200 --> 09:52.860
Alright.

09:54.200 --> 09:55.180
Go!

10:03.960 --> 10:06.090
Supreme Ultimate: Slash of Destiny!

10:13.290 --> 10:15.999
Filo! Hit the Orochi's barrier!

10:16.000 --> 10:17.370
Okay!

10:24.310 --> 10:27.369
Looks like the Sakura Stone of Destiny's
blessing has been destroyed.

10:27.370 --> 10:29.189
Good, let's press the attack!

10:29.190 --> 10:31.140
Descent of the Thunder God!

10:32.890 --> 10:35.490
Finally it's my turn!

10:39.330 --> 10:41.750
Eagle Piercing Shot!

10:42.790 --> 10:46.500
Hengen Muso Throwing Technique:
Rolling Spin!

10:50.550 --> 10:52.320
Critical Wire.

10:57.440 --> 11:00.160
Drifa Chain Lightning!

11:02.310 --> 11:03.809
Now, Raphtalia!

11:03.810 --> 11:06.350
Stardust Blade!

11:17.780 --> 11:20.059
It's not really harder
than I thought.

11:20.060 --> 11:21.189
Yeah.

11:21.190 --> 11:22.700
Lady Raphtalia!

11:23.150 --> 11:25.660
The cavalry sure took
its time getting here.

11:33.460 --> 11:38.489
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

11:38.490 --> 11:39.640
What's going on?

11:39.970 --> 11:42.610
It's giving off a strange reaction. Like...

11:45.190 --> 11:47.850
Get away from Orochi! Now!

11:57.070 --> 11:58.610
Shooting Star Shield!

12:07.340 --> 12:08.599
The barrier...!

12:08.600 --> 12:09.799
This isn't good.

12:09.800 --> 12:13.380
Looks like the enemy is a more troublesome
monster than we thought.

12:16.180 --> 12:17.330
What?!

12:23.250 --> 12:24.469
Another one?!

12:24.470 --> 12:25.929
- So big! What's that?!
- This is a different one

12:25.930 --> 12:27.180
- So big! What's that?!
- from the one we just killed!

12:27.680 --> 12:30.649
It was what you might call a clone.

12:30.650 --> 12:33.610
Taking down the main body
won't be so easy.

12:34.030 --> 12:35.400
I'll hold it back!

12:37.290 --> 12:37.990
I'll help too!

12:42.200 --> 12:45.310
It's even been buffed a bit too.

12:45.890 --> 12:48.049
Is there nothing we can do?

12:48.050 --> 12:50.169
It is still a dragon, after all.

12:50.170 --> 12:53.250
Surely you know a little about
the biology of dragons, correct?

12:53.820 --> 12:57.720
The core stone... That explains
why the earlier one didn't have it.

12:58.100 --> 13:01.179
So that means the real body
is further inside.

13:01.180 --> 13:03.839
We'll have to suppress the clone
so it doesn't self-destruct,

13:03.840 --> 13:06.689
then seize the core stone
from the main body, right?

13:06.690 --> 13:09.649
Indeed. Do that, and the rest
is just an empty shell.

13:09.650 --> 13:12.209
And after we seize it,
what do we do with the core stone?

13:12.210 --> 13:15.619
This weakest Dragon Emperor will suppress it.

13:15.620 --> 13:16.899
Can you really do that?

13:16.900 --> 13:21.560
If it's only the core, even the weakest
can handle suppressing it easily.

13:26.580 --> 13:28.410
That's awesome!

13:34.040 --> 13:37.279
That Orochi seems to be
targeting only Raphtalia.

13:37.280 --> 13:41.939
Maybe it bears a deep grudge against Raphtalia
since she resembles the Heavenly Emperor.

13:41.940 --> 13:43.549
That's pretty unpleasant.

13:43.550 --> 13:48.139
We could use her as bait
to draw the clones away.

13:48.140 --> 13:52.289
Yeah. Without Raphtalia,
we can't neutralize its blessing.

13:52.290 --> 13:54.559
Let's handle the clones with numbers.

13:54.560 --> 13:57.150
We've got the revolutionary
forces with us, after all, right?

13:57.560 --> 13:58.859
Y-Yeah!

13:58.860 --> 14:03.229
Alright. Raphtalia, Filo, Sadeena,
Gaelion, and Raph-chan,

14:03.230 --> 14:04.740
you'll handle the main body with me.

14:05.100 --> 14:06.989
The rest of you hold off the clones.

14:06.990 --> 14:10.199
Don't finish them off, just buy us time!

14:10.200 --> 14:11.309
Understood.

14:11.310 --> 14:14.040
Eeh, we have to keep it alive?!

14:14.990 --> 14:17.029
If only I hadn't thrown away my weapon...!

14:17.030 --> 14:19.759
I got your back, Atla!

14:19.760 --> 14:22.059
We'll cover Lady Raphtalia and the others!

14:22.060 --> 14:24.899
Cavaliers, return to town
and issue the evacuation order!

14:24.900 --> 14:25.720
Yes, sir!

14:30.180 --> 14:31.139
Let's go!

14:31.140 --> 14:33.719
Zweite Thunder Burst!

14:33.720 --> 14:35.060
Shooting Star Bow!

14:50.590 --> 14:52.619
Are you okay, Raphtalia?

14:52.620 --> 14:54.210
Yes, somehow...

14:55.670 --> 14:59.969
The magic energy... Or rather,
the ominous aura is awfully thick here.

14:59.970 --> 15:01.510
We can't stay long.

15:02.030 --> 15:05.650
It's gradually eroding the barrier
that protects the land.

15:06.250 --> 15:10.719
Either way, we need to hurry,
or other seals might break too.

15:10.720 --> 15:14.560
Damn it, this government really
doesn't do anything good.

15:20.400 --> 15:23.680
I can read this... Is this Hero Script?

15:25.380 --> 15:28.360
‘Methods of Strengthening
the Shield Holy Weapon'?!

15:34.870 --> 15:36.710
I sense magic power from it.

15:37.060 --> 15:38.670
I'll read more.

15:39.320 --> 15:42.599
‘Method one for strengthening
the Shield Holy Weapon:

15:42.600 --> 15:46.630
share the power-up methods from other
Holy Weapons and Vassal Weapons.'

15:49.850 --> 15:50.989
A METHOD FOR STRENGTHENING THE HOLY WEAPON
I already know all of this.

15:50.990 --> 15:52.159
SHARE THE POWER-UP METHODS
I already know all of this.

15:52.160 --> 15:53.810
FROM OTHER HOLY WEAPONS AND VASSAL WEAPONS
This is useless.

15:54.320 --> 15:56.050
What could this mean?

15:56.570 --> 16:00.310
If Ren or Itsuki read this,
they might see something different.

16:00.620 --> 16:02.770
We should bring them here
once things are settled.

16:08.620 --> 16:10.240
It's below here?

16:12.760 --> 16:15.540
Wait! Everyone, back up to the surface!

16:24.210 --> 16:26.119
That was close.

16:26.120 --> 16:28.219
A big waste of time too.

16:28.220 --> 16:30.679
- Let go of me!
- Don't say that. Look there.

16:30.680 --> 16:32.380
The main body is coming out.

16:39.810 --> 16:43.769
That purple light at the base
of that Orochi is the core.

16:43.770 --> 16:46.379
So it's the same plan as before.

16:46.380 --> 16:47.740
This is nothing like the clones.

16:48.080 --> 16:53.199
It's steadily swelling as it gathers power
dissolved from the dragon veins.

16:53.200 --> 16:57.299
We can't hold the clones off much longer!

16:57.300 --> 16:59.529
Then let's just finish this quickly.

16:59.530 --> 17:03.039
Swift and minimalistic,
such as how Naofumi likes it.

17:03.040 --> 17:05.419
You're unusually motivated this time.

17:05.420 --> 17:06.779
Of course.

17:06.780 --> 17:10.010
One day, this will be
the country you rule.

17:10.360 --> 17:12.379
If it's destroyed,
that would be a problem.

17:12.380 --> 17:15.410
No. If anything, it's more like...

17:16.440 --> 17:19.689
Anyway, I'll just have to give it my all!

17:19.690 --> 17:21.810
Yeah, we'll talk about it later!

17:22.650 --> 17:23.209
WOULD YOU LIKE TO EMPOWER THE TARGET

17:23.210 --> 17:24.429
WOULD YOU LIKE TO EMPOWER THE TARGET
Sadeena,

17:24.430 --> 17:26.559
WOULD YOU LIKE TO EMPOWER THE TARGET
it looks like I can command you to transform.

17:26.560 --> 17:27.279
AND FORCE A BEAST TRANSFORMATION?
Oh?

17:27.280 --> 17:28.359
Wanna try it?

17:28.360 --> 17:30.860
Of course! Is there even another option?

17:31.190 --> 17:32.609
Let's do this then!

17:32.610 --> 17:34.570
Sakura Sphere of Influence!

17:52.990 --> 17:55.049
Wow, amazing!

17:55.050 --> 17:57.929
Such power flowing through me!

17:57.930 --> 18:00.280
Is this your love, Naofumi?

18:00.890 --> 18:03.369
That's her beast form?

18:03.370 --> 18:05.610
I can feel an incredible strength from her.

18:06.600 --> 18:09.159
I think I even heard
the Water Dragon's voice.

18:09.160 --> 18:10.989
Right now, I feel like I could do anything!

18:10.990 --> 18:13.409
Then hurry up and take care of this already!

18:13.410 --> 18:14.699
Okay, okay~

18:14.700 --> 18:16.620
Hm? Do I chant it like this?

18:17.000 --> 18:18.260
Thunder God!

18:21.080 --> 18:23.540
And then... Sea God!

18:26.380 --> 18:30.339
This is the true form
of the Water Dragon's priestess.

18:30.340 --> 18:33.050
It's like a battle between gods.

18:33.560 --> 18:35.849
Raphtalia, let's finish this in one strike!

18:35.850 --> 18:36.900
Yes!

18:45.560 --> 18:48.360
Supreme Ultimate: Slash of Destiny!

18:50.110 --> 18:52.650
Alright, the blessing's gone!
Finish it off!

19:00.640 --> 19:02.490
Kagura Dance of Sakura,
First Formation:

19:02.830 --> 19:03.790
Blossom!

19:23.450 --> 19:25.649
We can win!

19:25.650 --> 19:31.090
These people surely can defeat the current
Heavenly Emperor and Regent Makina!

19:31.550 --> 19:34.439
Everyone, raise your victory cry!

19:34.440 --> 19:38.900
Ei! Ei! Ohhh!

19:45.560 --> 19:49.330
Looks like this is Orochi's core stone.

19:51.350 --> 19:53.300
A sword, huh...

19:53.760 --> 19:56.759
"The Cursed Ama-no-Murakumo Sword."

19:56.760 --> 19:59.469
THE CURSED AMA-NO-MURAKUMO SWORD
Just touching it feels like you'd get cursed.

19:59.470 --> 20:03.599
But we can't just leave it lying around.
What should we do...?

20:03.600 --> 20:06.099
Looks like you managed to defeat it.

20:06.100 --> 20:07.810
Amazing.

20:08.290 --> 20:11.649
I'd heard your battles were fierce,

20:11.650 --> 20:13.369
but this is beyond what I imagined.

20:13.370 --> 20:14.509
Well, yeah.

20:14.510 --> 20:18.109
Wow, quite the fine sword.

20:18.110 --> 20:20.800
So this is its true form, huh.

20:22.590 --> 20:23.490
Hey!

20:27.960 --> 20:30.470
Shut it. Don't make a fuss.

20:32.750 --> 20:37.329
This thing's insanely cursed.
You can't use it right away.

20:37.330 --> 20:40.519
You're just casually holding it...
Are you sure that's okay?

20:40.520 --> 20:42.289
I'm a blacksmith, you know.

20:42.290 --> 20:44.959
How could I do my job
if weapons started cursing me?

20:44.960 --> 20:46.639
As expected of my master.

20:46.640 --> 20:50.259
Can you at least stop it from
going on another rampage?

20:50.260 --> 20:52.560
Hah? How the hell should I know?

20:53.290 --> 20:55.089
Please?

20:55.090 --> 20:58.149
If that monster appeared again,
it'd be terrible.

20:58.150 --> 21:00.469
Fine, young lady.

21:00.470 --> 21:02.869
I'll do something about it.

21:02.870 --> 21:04.620
This old man...!

21:05.050 --> 21:07.830
Well, at least Orochi is defeated.

21:08.220 --> 21:11.169
Now we must spread the news.

21:11.170 --> 21:13.769
That the revolutionary forces with
the new Heavenly Emperor

21:13.770 --> 21:18.550
have crushed the schemes of a government
that cares nothing for its people.

21:19.350 --> 21:22.180
In other words, justice is on our side.

21:23.590 --> 21:25.509
It's just for show.

21:25.510 --> 21:28.230
You don't actually need to
become the Heavenly Emperor.

21:28.710 --> 21:30.690
Yes...

21:32.260 --> 21:36.779
Um, I've been wondering
since before we set out...

21:36.780 --> 21:40.269
Ah, this one may look like this,
but she's actually a Filolial.

21:40.270 --> 21:42.740
Yeah! My name's Filo!

21:43.080 --> 21:46.120
When raised by a Hero,
they grow in a special way.

21:46.700 --> 21:47.700
I knew it.

21:48.340 --> 21:52.420
That white form,
with a cherry-blossom pattern...

21:52.790 --> 21:57.380
We may well be able to use this
to our greater advantage!

23:36.230 --> 23:40.940
#09 ZODIA
